{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>הילוד</b> Twice in the Masorah: here and the other: גם הבן הילוד לך מות ימות, regarding David — to teach: just as David was punished that he raised up against him evil from his own house, for Absalom his son sought to kill him, so too Pharaoh — Moses, who was raised in his house, rose against him and brought upon him all the plagues."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:39.614503755Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}